      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QLoRA compresses the base for fine-tuning. Pruning keeps a sparse version of a model.\nDistillation transfers the teacher\u2019s output behavior to a separate student.",
