  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Compression has three different levers",
    "description": "QLoRA freezes a 4-bit NF4 base and trains LoRA adapters, reducing memory for fine-tuning. Pruning removes weights and only speeds inference when hardware supports the sparsity pattern. Distillation trains a smaller student to match a teacher\u2019s soft outputs or sequences."
  }
}
